<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A rating to Sun Hung Kai's samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A rating to Sun Hung Kai's samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday that it had assigned its A rating to 32 billion yen worth of floating-rate samurai notes issued by Sun Hung Kai Properties Treasury (Cayman) Ltd.</p>
<p>The samurai notes, due on June 29, 1999, are guaranteed by Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that the outlook of the notes was stable.</p>
</text>
